    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54214" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-ᾰκολουθ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>follow after</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπίσω τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Je.</u>
					17.16
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Longus
				3.15
			</span></i> codd.: c. gen., Dioxi<i><span class="en">
				pp.2
			</span></i> (s. v.l.); <i>comply with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ ταῖς τῶν ἀνθρώπων εὐχαῖς ὁ θεὸς
					κατηκολούθει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					388
				</span></i>
			; <i>obey</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμῳ,
			προστάγμασιν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Da.</u>
				9.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ma.</u>
				6.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			; <i>follow</i> a historical or philosophical authority, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.146S.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀράτῳ, Δημοκρίτῳ</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.56.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1108f
			</span></i>; in fortification, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ταῖς ὀχυρότησι τῶν τόπων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.42.2
				</span></i>
			; <i>emulate, imitate</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδυνάτοις
				ἐπιβολαἶς</span> Hegetorap.<i><span class="en">
				Apollon.
			</span></i> Cit.<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τοῖς ἱεροῖς</span>,
			mistranslation of <i>prosecuisset</i>, as though <i>prosecutus
				esset</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				5
			</span></i>: abs., <i>obey instructions,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PAmh.
				2.31.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>.</div>
